WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.523
The internet has excellent teaching resources, and a lot of wrong information.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:09.402
Search with specific words, and add the type you want, like worksheet.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.299
Ask who made it, and when it was updated.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:16.766
Check it is accurate, and that it fits your learners and syllabus.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.412
Use openly licensed resources, and credit the author.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:31.929
Before you move on, check: Search with specific words and a file type. Check who made a resource, and when. Find one openly licensed resource. Credit the author.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.900
In the next lesson: Lesson planning tools.
